# The game's Help Desk, the way a player turns it on or off: pause, Options, HelpDesk, for the game's tips in voice and text (a
# tester missed the Trespasser's). From 0.1.17 a new game, and so a --level run, has both on, and the two presses here turn them
# off (up to 0.1.16 they started off and these turned them on). QUEST_HELP_TRACE=1 says the voice and text as they change.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3000 y 1
3006 y 0
3120 hand_pitch 0
3140 hand_pitch 28
3200 hand_pitch -5.4
3230 shot pause
3240 right_trigger 1
3246 right_trigger 0
3340 shot options
# The list's first row, HelpDesk.
3360 hand_pitch 23.6
3420 shot on-row
3440 right_trigger 1
3446 right_trigger 0
3560 shot helpdesk
# Its two rows: Voice, then Text, each toggled by the hand.
3580 hand_pitch 13.0
3640 right_trigger 1
3646 right_trigger 0
3720 shot voice-off
3740 hand_pitch 9.6
3800 right_trigger 1
3806 right_trigger 0
3880 shot both-off
3900 quit 0
